Date: 2026-06-2
Branch: sun/apriltag-1

Historical note: the shell launch/config files referenced below were later
replaced by the ROS 2 launch flow in `jmu_lunabotics`.

//TODO:
- Fix the pose estimate system for apriltags

AprilTag Integration

    New AprilTag detection pipeline (sensor/webcam/publish_apriltag.sh): Publishes AprilTag detections from webcam frames using the apriltag_ros package
        Rectifies raw camera images before processing
        Configurable tag ID, family, and size
        Multiple tuning parameters (threads, decimation, blur, refinement, etc.)
        Outputs detections and transforms for detected tags
        Republishes the selected tag transform as a camera-relative pose topic
        Republishes camera-relative distance as a scalar topic for quick consumers

New Pose Republisher

    Added sensor/webcam/publish_apriltag_pose.py
        Subscribes to /tf for the configured AprilTag frame
        Publishes geometry_msgs/PoseStamped on /apriltag/camera_pose by default
        Publishes std_msgs/Float64 on /apriltag/camera_distance by default

Configuration Updates

    Added new environment variables in launch/robot_config.sh:
        ENABLE_APRILTAG, APRILTAG_TAG_ID, APRILTAG_TAG_FAMILY, APRILTAG_TAG_SIZE_METERS
        APRILTAG_POSE_TOPIC, APRILTAG_DISTANCE_TOPIC
        CAMERA_NAME for camera identification

Camera Publishing Enhancements (sensor/webcam/publish_camera.sh)

    Added camera name support (CAMERA_NAME parameter)
    Added camera calibration file support with both file and URL options
    Default calibration file: webcam_calibration.yaml
    Calibration info logged on startup

New Camera Calibration File

    Added sensor/webcam/webcam_calibration.yaml with baseline calibration parameters for the webcamera
    Includes camera matrix, distortion coefficients, and projection matrix

Launcher Updates (launch/launch_sensors.sh)

    Integrated AprilTag publisher alongside camera publisher
    Added process management for AprilTag node
    Updated messaging from "Camera publisher" to "Sensor publishers"
    All AprilTag-related environment variables exported

Bootstrap Script Updates (scripts/bootstrap_dev.sh)

    Added helper function apt_get() with timeout handling (300s for package lock)
    Added new ROS packages to installation:
        ros-jazzy-apriltag-ros
        ros-jazzy-camera-calibration
        ros-jazzy-image-proc
